    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i'm just going through the motions. every single morning is the same... i wake up, i see his things, and i just feel this crushing weight. it's like the world has moved on but i'm just stuck in this void. sometimes i think i'm just waiting for something to happen so i don't have to feel this way anymore.",
